 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Rates are integer cents per hour; times are integer seconds; a delivery [startTime,endTime) costs rate*(end-start)/3600 cents exactly. Drivers are added once before their deliveries and may overlap deliveries. Cost results are the exact rational total rounded half-up to whole cents and formatted \"<dollars>.<cc>\". payUpTo(t) marks every recorded delivery with endTime <= t as paid (later deliveries stay unpaid until a later payUpTo covers them); getTotalCostUnpaid returns the total of unpaid deliveries.",
